TITLE 'APEEL FILE: PEEL18CV8 BASIC GATES'
Designer 'Robin Peel'
Date '8/16/87 '

Description

  This PEEL18CV8 application example implements several basic logic gates.
  The logic gates include an inverter, four-input AND, OR, NAND, and NOR
  gates, a four-input AND-OR- INVERT gate, a two- input XOR gate and a
  high-impedance buffer. Each gate uses one or more of the (A,B,C and D)
  inputs. Additionally, the high-impedance buffer uses the /HZ input for
  impedance control. The truth table for these gates can be examined in the
  test vectors. Note, the remaining unused input pins can be used as
  additional inputs into the gates.

End_Desc;

PEEL18CV8

A pin 1
B pin 2
C pin 3
D pin 4
!OE pin 9
IOC(12 'HZ_BUF' POS COM FEED_PIN)
IOC (13 'XOR' Pos OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (14 'AOI' Neg OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (15 'NOR' Neg OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (16 'OR' Pos OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (17 'NAND' Neg OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (18 'AND' Pos OutCom Feed_Pin)
IOC (19 'NOT' Pos OutCom Feed_Pin)

AC NODE 21;
SP NODE 22;

Define

EQUATIONS

AC = 0;
SP = 0;

NOT.COM = !A ;
AND.COM = A & B & C & D;
NAND.COM = (A & B & C & D) ;
OR.COM = A # B # C # D;
NOR.COM = (A # B # C # D) ;
AOI.COM = (A & B # C & D) ;
XOR.COM = A & !B # !A & B;
HZ_BUF.COM = A;
HZ_BUF.OE = OE ;

XOR.And = 1;
AOI.And = 1;
NOR.And = 1;
OR.And = 1;
NAND.And = 1;
AND.And = 1;
NOT.And = 1;
